{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/umaExchangeTicket(ticket:claimToken:credentials:tenantID:)"},"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/oauth2\/token"},{"type":"text","text":" with the UMA ticket grant (§20.1) — redeem a permission ticket for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Requesting Party Token."}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"umaExchangeTicket(ticket:claimToken:credentials:tenantID:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"umaExchangeTicket","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ticket","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","text":"Sensitive","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"claimToken","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","text":"Sensitive","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"credentials","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK20UmaClientCredentialsV","text":"UmaClientCredentials","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tenantID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK20RequestingPartyTokenV","text":"RequestingPartyToken","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC17umaExchangeTicket6ticket10claimToken11credentials8tenantIDAA015RequestingPartyI0VAA9SensitiveVySSG_AmA03UmaC11CredentialsVSSSgtYaKF","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/umaexchangeticket(ticket:claimtoken:credentials:tenantid:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"umaExchangeTicket","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ticket","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sensitive","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"claimToken","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sensitive","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"credentials","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UmaClientCredentials","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK20UmaClientCredentialsV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/UmaClientCredentials"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tenantID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RequestingPartyToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK20RequestingPartyTokenV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/RequestingPartyToken"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike the Protection API above, this is a token-endpoint grant: the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"client","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" authenticates","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through the form body (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"client_secret_post"},{"text":"), so ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"credentials"},{"text":" is required.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What this method deliberately does "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" do:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No retry, ever"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" (§20.2 rule 6) — not on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"5xx"},{"type":"text","text":", not on a timeout, not on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalid_grant"},{"type":"text","text":". This is the one documented exception to §16, and a security rule rather"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than a performance one: the ticket is consumed "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"before","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" the request is evaluated, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"failed exchange has already spent it, and a retry is a second redemption — exactly the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"concurrent redemption a server whose storage engine this SDK cannot attest may admit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"twice ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ilpanich\/axiam#302"},{"type":"text","text":"). The property"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holds structurally here: this call goes through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AxiamClient\/rawSend(method:path:body:)"},{"type":"text","text":"’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"absolute-URL sibling and never enters "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"retryingPOST(operation:path:body:)"},{"type":"text","text":"’s budget."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"No defaulted ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"claimToken"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (rule 2). It is the only channel that names the requesting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"party; defaulting it to the resource server’s own PAT would mint an RPT for the resource"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"server rather than for the user. An empty one is refused client-side, with no wire call,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so a request that could not have succeeded never spends a ticket."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No auto-narrowing on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"access_denied"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (rule 3). A partial grant is refused whole, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether two-of-three permissions is useful is the calling application’s judgement.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No adoption"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (rule 4). The RPT is the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"requesting party’s","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" token; adopting it would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"re-privilege every later call this resource server makes as that user. This client has no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bearer-credential slot to adopt into at all — its session lives in ","type":"text"},{"code":"httpOnly","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" cookies —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the rule holds by construction.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No refresh token","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" (rule 5) — the grant issues none, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/RequestingPartyToken","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nowhere to put one."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The four ticket refusals — unknown, expired, already used, minted by another client — all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrive as one "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalid_grant"},{"type":"text","text":", and this SDK does not guess which (§20.4): the server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"collapses them because telling them apart lets a caller probe for live ticket handles."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient":{"title":"AxiamClient","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The AXIAM REST client (§1–§7, §9 of CONTRACT.md).","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxiamClient","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AxiamClient","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","title":"AxiamSDK","type":